{"id":"c25","kind":"doc","text":"원문은 computerd 가 디스크보다 빠른 시나리오를 여덟 개라고 쓰면서 이름은 일곱 개만 든다","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"cloudflare/computer@c7bdfcb (0.1.0-alpha.1) 기준","evidence":[{"source":"r1","locator":"docs/19_performance.md:51","quote":"## Where computerd is faster than the disk baseline\n\nThe in-memory inode store beats real disk on metadata-heavy work:\n`stat`, `rm`, `mkdir tree`, `find tree`, `git init`, `git clone`,\n`npm init`. Those eight scenarios cover most of the day-to-day cost\nof tools like `git status`, module resolution, and incremental\nbuilds."}]}
